# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PARTICIPANT DATA -- NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw sessions contain Prolific participant IDs. Those are pseudonymous
# identifiers that can be linked back to a person through the platform, so they
# are personal data under GDPR and almost certainly under your ethics approval.
# Keep them off GitHub entirely, including in private repos.
#
# Publish only the de-identified derived tables, and only once you have checked
# that participant_id has been replaced with a study-local code.
data/raw/
data/raw_sim/
data/derived/
*.session.json
trustloop_*.json

# Figures are regenerable; keep the repo light. Delete this line if you would
# rather version the exact figures that went into a submission.
figures/

